#: ../../../ScalableStaticAnalysis/user-docs/SourceEditGeneration.md:1
msgid "Source Edit Generation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ScalableStaticAnalysis/user-docs/SourceEditGeneration.md:3
msgid ""
"Source edit generation relies on a `WPASuite` result produced by an earlier "
"whole-program analysis. It runs alongside the normal compile and emits two "
"per-translation-unit artifacts:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ScalableStaticAnalysis/user-docs/SourceEditGeneration.md:7
msgid ""
"a *source-edit file* (`--ssaf-src-edit-file=`) containing `clang::tooling::"
"Replacement` records ready for `clang-apply-replacements`,"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ScalableStaticAnalysis/user-docs/SourceEditGeneration.md:10
msgid ""
"a *transformation-report file* (`--ssaf-transformation-report-file=`) "
"containing diagnostic-style findings."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ScalableStaticAnalysis/user-docs/SourceEditGeneration.md:13
msgid "Driver options"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ScalableStaticAnalysis/user-docs/SourceEditGeneration.md:15
msgid ""
"Five options control the pipeline; they are all both `--ssaf-…` driver "
"options and `cc1` options. The compilation-unit identifier is shared with "
"the summary extraction step. A given compilation unit needs to receive the "
"same identifier for both summary extraction and source edit generation. The "
"link-unit identifier must match the identifier of the link unit that this "
"compilation unit was linked into."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ScalableStaticAnalysis/user-docs/SourceEditGeneration.md:26
msgid "Option"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ScalableStaticAnalysis/user-docs/SourceEditGeneration.md:27
msgid "Purpose"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ScalableStaticAnalysis/user-docs/SourceEditGeneration.md:28
msgid "``--ssaf-source-transformation=<name>``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ScalableStaticAnalysis/user-docs/SourceEditGeneration.md:29
msgid "Name of the transformation to run."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ScalableStaticAnalysis/user-docs/SourceEditGeneration.md:30
msgid "``--ssaf-global-scope-analysis-result=<path>.<format>``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ScalableStaticAnalysis/user-docs/SourceEditGeneration.md:31
msgid "WPASuite input. The extension selects the serialization format."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ScalableStaticAnalysis/user-docs/SourceEditGeneration.md:32
msgid "``--ssaf-src-edit-file=<path>``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ScalableStaticAnalysis/user-docs/SourceEditGeneration.md:33
msgid ""
"Source-edit output. Always written as a ``clang-apply-replacements``-"
"compatible YAML document; the file extension is not interpreted."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ScalableStaticAnalysis/user-docs/SourceEditGeneration.md:36
msgid "``--ssaf-transformation-report-file=<path>``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ScalableStaticAnalysis/user-docs/SourceEditGeneration.md:37
msgid ""
"Transformation-report output. Always written as a SARIF JSON document; the "
"file extension is not interpreted."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ScalableStaticAnalysis/user-docs/SourceEditGeneration.md:39
msgid "``--ssaf-compilation-unit-id=<id>``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ScalableStaticAnalysis/user-docs/SourceEditGeneration.md:40
msgid ""
"Stable identifier for this translation unit (also required by the summary "
"extraction)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ScalableStaticAnalysis/user-docs/SourceEditGeneration.md:42
msgid "``--ssaf-link-unit-id=<id>``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ScalableStaticAnalysis/user-docs/SourceEditGeneration.md:43
msgid ""
"Stable identifier of the link unit this translation unit was linked into."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ScalableStaticAnalysis/user-docs/SourceEditGeneration.md:47
msgid ""
"When `--ssaf-source-transformation=` is non-empty the framework wraps the "
"active `FrontendAction` in a `SourceTransformationFrontendAction`; otherwise "
"the compile is byte-for-byte unchanged."
msgstr ""

